     "id": "part_mvamfwkv_1673e4c6-7d9d-4b69-b794-825ee0d32876",
     "sequence": 0,
     "time_created": "2026-10-16 15:03:37",
     "data": {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "在这台 macOS 机器上做几项只读检查，不要安装、修改任何东西：\n\n1. `lsof -iTCP:3000 -sTCP:LISTEN 2>/dev/null` 和 `lsof -iTCP:3001 -sTCP:LISTEN 2>/dev/null` —— 报告这两个端口是否空闲\n2. `which ffmpeg ffprobe` —— 是否安装了 ffmpeg\n3. 网络可达性，各用 `curl -sI -m 8 <url> | head -3` 测并报告 HTTP 状态码（超时/失败也要报告）：\n   - https://start.spring.io\n   - https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/\n   - https://registry.npmjs.org\n   - https://sample-videos.com/video321/mp4/720/big_buck_bunny_720p_1mb.mp4\n   - https://test-videos.co.uk/vids/bigbuckbunny/mp4/h264/360/Big_Buck_Bunny_360_10s_1MB.mp4\n   - https://download.samplelib.com/mp4/sample-5s.mp4\n4. `ls ~/.m2/repository 2>/dev/null | head -5` —— 本地 Maven 仓库是否已有缓存依赖\n\n最后汇总：端口 3000/3001 状态 / ffmpeg 有无 / 各 URL 可达状态 / Maven 本地缓存有无。",
      "time": {
       "start": 1792134217903,
       "end": 1792134217903
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
